WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.482
That night, the jailer's daughter returned.

2
00:00:19.483 --> 00:00:21.882
Her aunt was with her.

3
00:00:21.883 --> 00:00:25.143
The aunt carried a big bag.

4
00:00:25.144 --> 00:00:29.351
"Here, Mr. Toad!" said the washwoman.

5
00:00:29.352 --> 00:00:31.444
"I have your clothes."

6
00:00:31.445 --> 00:00:35.806
"And here is something for you!" said Toad.

7
00:00:35.807 --> 00:00:39.084
He gave her four gold coins.

8
00:00:39.085 --> 00:00:42.535
The old woman opened the bag.

9
00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:47.145
"Here's my old dress and an apron," she said.

10
00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:51.278
She gave Toad a shawl and a bonnet too.

11
00:00:51.279 --> 00:00:55.868
"Now you must tie me up," said the washwoman.

12
00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:59.605
"What?" asked Toad, surprised.

13
00:00:59.606 --> 00:01:01.846
The washwoman explained.

14
00:01:01.847 --> 00:01:05.002
"People will think you did it," she said.

15
00:01:05.003 --> 00:01:08.113
"I don't want them to know I helped you."

16
00:01:08.114 --> 00:01:12.142
"What a wonderful idea!" said Toad.

17
00:01:12.143 --> 00:01:15.075
"You are a very clever woman.

18
00:01:15.076 --> 00:01:19.091
Everyone will think I'm dangerous!"

19
00:01:19.092 --> 00:01:22.414
Toad tied up the washwoman.

20
00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:27.473
"Now," said the jailer's daughter, "it's your turn, Toad.

21
00:01:27.474 --> 00:01:29.558
Take off your coat."

22
00:01:29.559 --> 00:01:33.537
She helped Toad put on the dress and apron.

23
00:01:33.538 --> 00:01:36.337
"Here's the shawl," she said.

24
00:01:36.338 --> 00:01:37.611
"And the bonnet!"

25
00:01:37.612 --> 00:01:40.678
Toad looked at himself.

26
00:01:40.679 --> 00:01:45.800
"I don't look so dangerous now," he said sadly.

27
00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:49.958
"You look just like my aunt!" the daughter said.

28
00:01:49.959 --> 00:01:52.693
"Will it work?" Toad asked.

29
00:01:52.694 --> 00:01:55.868
"Just act like an old washwoman.

30
00:01:55.869 --> 00:01:59.535
And don't talk so much," said the jailer's daughter.

31
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:02.079
"Good-bye, Toad," she said.

32
00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.999
"And good luck."
